    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living inspired-by long-eye form only: smooth oval tripartite shell, coherent head/thorax/tail and tapered high eye towers rooted in the cephalon. AMNH named Asaphus kowalewskii reference supports conspicuous stalked eyes; does not establish this for the whole genus. Nominal75mm body, palette, shallow segmentation, pose and restrained ventral hints are art choices, not exact specimen/soft-anatomy/movement reconstruction.",
      "zh": "原创活体inspired-by，仅选高眼柱形态：光滑椭圆三叶甲，头胸尾连续，高眼柱渐细并根植头甲。AMNH具名Asaphus kowalewskii支持长眼柱，不推广为全属特征。75毫米名义体长、配色、浅分节、姿态及克制腹面提示均为美术设定，不是精确标本、软体或运动复原。"
    },
